Files (files)
  Your files on all your devices, shared with people you choose.

Actions:
  files.delete  destructive, approval: agents  Delete files or folders from all devices.
  files.keep    write                          Keep a folder on this device.
  files.list    read                           List a folder.
  files.share   write                          Share a folder with people.

More: sol do files.<action> --help
